<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .header-image-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .image-cell { flex: 1; height: 150px; overflow: hidden; }
  .image-cell img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .content-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .bullet-list { margin-left: 20px; }
  .footer-logo { position: absolute; bottom: 50px; right: 60px; }
  .footer-text { position: absolute; bottom: 30px; right: 60px; font-size: 10pt; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-image-container">
    <div class="image-cell"><img src="placeholder_image_1.jpg" alt="Image 1"></div>
    <div class="image-cell"><img src="placeholder_image_2.jpg" alt="Image 2"></div>
    <div class="image-cell"><img src="placeholder_image_3.jpg" alt="Image 3"></div>
    <div class="image-cell"><img src="placeholder_image_4.jpg" alt="Image 4"></div>
    <div class="image-cell"><img src="placeholder_image_5.jpg" alt="Image 5"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-title">
    <h1>PARTIAL SALES AND USE TAX EXEMPTION FOR EQUIPMENT USED IN RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT</h1>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Date: <span data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></p>
    <p>Name: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Title: <span data-field="title">{{ title }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE VICE CHANCELLOR</p>
      <p>AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</p>
      <p>Accounting and Financial Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Partial Exemption Overview</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="content-section">
    <ul class="bullet-list">
      <li>The partial exemption became effective <span data-field="effective_date">{{ effective_date }}</span>.
        <ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <li>Sales or use tax reduction of <span data-field="reduction_rate_1">{{ reduction_rate_1 }}</span> through <span data-field="date_1">{{ date_1 }}</span>, and a reduction of <span data-field="reduction_rate_2">{{ reduction_rate_2 }}</span> after that, through <span data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</span>.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Three requirements to obtain exemption:
        <ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <li>qualified property</li>
          <li>purchased by a qualified person,</li>
          <li>property used more than 50% of the time in qualifying R&D areas.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>The exemption applies to aggregate purchases of <span data-field="purchase_limit">{{ purchase_limit }}</span> per calendar year.
        <ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <li>Currently we are applying this limit to <span data-field="application_scope">{{ application_scope }}</span> wide.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE VICE CHANCELLOR</p>
      <p>AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</p>
      <p>Accounting and Financial Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Partial Exemption - Qualified Person</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="content-section">
    <ul class="bullet-list">
      <li><span data-field="qualified_person_statement">{{ qualified_person_statement }}</span></li>
      <li>However, only certain Departments may use partial exemption.
        <ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-top: 10px;">
          <li>Departments conducting research in qualifying areas may be eligible. (e.g. <span data-field="example_field">{{ example_field }}</span>)</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE VICE CHANCELLOR</p>
      <p>AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</p>
      <p>Accounting and Financial Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Partial Exemption - Qualifying R&D Areas</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="content-section">
    <p>The exemption applies to R&D areas which fall under NAICS (North American Industry Classification System) codes <span data-field="naics_code_1">{{ naics_code_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="naics_code_2">{{ naics_code_2 }}</span>, and are described below:</p>
    <p><strong>NAICS code <span data-field="naics_code_1_label">{{ naics_code_1_label }}</span> –</strong></p>
    <p><span data-field="naics_code_1_description">{{ naics_code_1_description }}</span></p>
    <p><strong>NAICS code <span data-field="naics_code_2_label">{{ naics_code_2_label }}</span> –</strong></p>
    <p><span data-field="naics_code_2_description">{{ naics_code_2_description }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE VICE CHANCELLOR</p>
      <p>AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</p>
      <p>Accounting and Financial Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Partial Exemption - Qualified Property</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="content-section">
    <p>Qualified property can be owned or leased and must meet the following requirements:</p>
    <ul class="bullet-list">
      <li>It must have a useful life of a year or more.</li>
      <li>It must be used primarily to conduct research (i.e. must not be used primarily for instruction, patient care, administration, general management or marketing).</li>
      <li>It must be used in California for at least <span data-field="minimum_usage_period">{{ minimum_usage_period }}</span> months after purchase.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE VICE CHANCELLOR</p>
      <p>AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</p>
      <p>Accounting and Financial Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Process for Claiming Partial Exemption</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="content-section">
    <p>We have developed a checklist to help determine if an equipment purchase qualifies for exemption. If your department is making an equipment purchase over <span data-field="purchase_threshold">{{ purchase_threshold }}</span> that may qualify, please send the following information to Purchasing with the requisition (and copy Tax Services at <span data-field="tax_services_email">{{ tax_services_email }}</span>).</p>
    <ul class="bullet-list">
      <li>Completed checklist (The checklist should be completed by the person who is most familiar with the research and development uses of the equipment.)</li>
      <li>Copy of existing information summarizing the purpose of the research and development being undertaken (e.g. grant document, proposal, article etc.)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>OFFICE OF THE VICE CHANCELLOR</p>
      <p>AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</p>
      <p>Accounting and Financial Services</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">PARTIAL SALES AND USE TAX EXEMPTION FOR MANUFACTURING AND R&D EQUIPMENT ELIGIBILITY CHECKLIST</h2>
  <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">Complete this form and attach to your KFS Requisition document. <a href="#" style="color: blue;">Add the Tax Processor group as an Ad Hoc approval routing prior to submitting the document.</a></p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Department: <span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Department contact name: <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span></p>
      <p>E-mail: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
      <p>Vendor: <span data-field="vendor_name">{{ vendor_name }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p>KFS Document #: <span data-field="kfs_document_number">{{ kfs_document_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Is the vendor collecting California sales tax? YES <input type="checkbox"> NO <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <p>Is the purchase in fulfillment of a federal contract? YES <input type="checkbox"> NO <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <p>If yes, will the federal government take title to the equipment upon purchase? YES <input type="checkbox"> NO <input type="checkbox"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">OVERVIEW OF EQUIPMENT AND RESEARCH ACTIVITIES</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Description of the equipment.</li>
    <li>Briefly describe the research and development uses of the equipment.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Specify the areas of research and development (Check all research areas which apply):</h3>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p><strong>NAICS Code 541711 –</strong> Research and development in Biotechnology (involves the study of microorganisms and cellular and bio-molecular processes to develop or alter living or non-living materials) - <input type="checkbox"></p>
      <p><strong>NAICS Code 541712 –</strong> Research and development in the physical, engineering and life sciences (other than biotechnology):</p>
      <p>Agriculture <input type="checkbox"> | Electronics <input type="checkbox"> | Environmental <input type="checkbox"> | Biology <input type="checkbox"> | Botany <input type="checkbox"> | Computers <input type="checkbox"> | Chemistry <input type="checkbox"> | Food <input type="checkbox"> | Fisheries <input type="checkbox"> | Forests <input type="checkbox"> | Geology <input type="checkbox"> | Health <input type="checkbox"> | Mathematics <input type="checkbox"> | Medicine <input type="checkbox"> | Oceanography <input type="checkbox"> | Pharmacy <input type="checkbox"> | Physics <input type="checkbox"> | Veterinary <input type="checkbox"> </p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <p><em>(Note: The list above is a simplified representation of the layout structure.)</em></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p><strong>OTHER EQUIPMENT INFORMATION</strong></p>
    <ol>
      <li>Will equipment be purchased <input type="checkbox"> or leased <input type="checkbox"> ?</li>
      <li>Does the equipment have a useful life of one year or more? (Supplies and other consumables with a useful life of less than one year do not qualify). YES <input type="checkbox"> NO <input type="checkbox"></li>
      <li>Will special facilities need to be built or special building modifications made to install, use or maintain the equipment? If yes, please explain.</li>
      <li>Will the equipment be used outside California? If so, please explain.</li>
      <li>Will the equipment be used in non-research activities (e.g. instruction, patient care, administration, management, marketing etc)? YES <input type="checkbox"> NO <input type="checkbox"></li>
      <li>Please indicate the estimated percentage of time that the equipment will be used for research vs. non-research activities: Research activities: <span data-field="research_percentage">{{ research_percentage }}</span> % Non-research activities: <span data-field="non_research_percentage">{{ non_research_percentage }}</span> %</li>
    </ol>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">For more information on this sales tax reduction program, from the State of California, go to: <a href="http://www.boe.ca.gov/sutax/manufacturing_exemptions.htm">http://www.boe.ca.gov/sutax/manufacturing_exemptions.htm</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_ucdavis_logo.png" alt="UCDavis Logo" style="width: 150px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">UCDAVIS</p>
      <p>UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA</p>
      <p>Page 1 of 2</p>
      <p>Rev. 9/14</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
